      "text_preview": "The Ld. ACCM vide impugned judgment dated 17.10.2022 had convicted the appellant for violation of offence punishable under Section 2(ia) r/w Rule 44(c) r/w S. 7 of PFA punishable under S.\n16(1)(a) of Prevention of Food Adulteration (hereina"
