      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At one point, the appellant has pleaded that he had not received the PA report and on the other hand he had taken the plea that the prosecution was instituted much later on 23.11.2009,\nwhile he received the PA report on 06.07.2009."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fbb28e73ff69434fbc45d292a58fc09d_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even otherwise also, respondent has duly proved the service of the PA report Ex.PW1/G through postal receipts Ex.PW1/K and Ex.PW1/L.\n10."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4b873819789d441f84b896f5971e8a35_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Now coming to the contention of appellant that the ld. ACMM has wrongly placed reliance on the PA report and his right to seek second opinion from CFL under 13(2) PFA was violated."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6e0af68f62444fa28b507805bb87b927_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is settled law that the accused has the right for getting the sample analyzed through CFL by moving appropriate application within the limitation period."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d573b1e6848e4e76a19425ef93cf8b45_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
