        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the contrary, PW-1 proved the postal receipt Ex.PW1/L and Ex.PW1/K.\nRavi Kumar vs Delhi Administration on 3 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/153473047/\n5"
    },
